This licence covers only the code in this repository.

It does not cover the software this tool downloads at run time, which keeps its
own licence and is never redistributed here:

  * OptiScaler and the OptiScaler_DLSSNR fork -- GPL-3.0.
    Downloaded from their own GitHub releases when you press Apply.
  * RenoDX -- MIT. Its colour composition is used by the fork, not by this code.
  * nvngx_dlssnr.dll and the other NVIDIA NGX libraries -- proprietary, NVIDIA.
    This tool never downloads or redistributes them; it only copies files that
    are already on your machine.
